1. Hardware Setup :
● ESP32 Dev Module
● MPU6050 Accelerometer
● Buzzer
● 5V Power Supply / USB Power
● Jumper Wires / Breadboard

2. Connection :

MPU6050 → ESP32 via I²C
● VCC → 3.3V
● GND → GND
● SDA → GPIO 21
● SCL → GPIO 22

Buzzer → GPIO 15 (or any digital pin)
● Positive → GPIO
● Negative → GND

3. Install required libraries :
● Wire.h
● WiFi.h
● WebServer.h
● MPU6050.h
● UniversalTelegramBot.h
